{"speciesId":446,"names":{"fr":"Goinfrex","es":"Munchlax","en":"Munchlax","ja":"ゴンベ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It wolfs down its weight in food once a day, swallowing food whole with almost no chewing."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Obnubilé par sa quête incessante de nourriture, il oublie parfois qu’il en a caché dans sa fourrure."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Obnubilé par sa quête incessante de nourriture, il oublie parfois qu’il en a caché dans sa fourrure."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il cache de la nourriture sous les grands poils de son corps, mais il finit souvent par l’oublier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Esconde comida bajo el largo pelo de su cuerpo, pero más tarde lo olvida."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"長い 体の 毛の 下に 食べ物を 隠す 習性。 隠したことを 忘れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Goinfrex cache de la nourriture dans sa fourrure en pagaille. Il avale tout en une bouchée."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"En el interior de su pelaje revuelto esconde la comida que luego engullirá de una vez."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ボサボサの 体毛の 中に 食べ物を 隠して 持ち歩く。 食べる ときは ゴクリと まる飲み。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il cache de la nourriture sous les grands poils de son corps, mais il finit souvent par l’oublier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Esconde comida bajo el largo pelo de su cuerpo, pero más tarde lo olvida."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"長い 体の 毛の 下に 食べ物を 隠す 習性。 隠したことを 忘れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Goinfrex cache de la nourriture dans sa fourrure en pagaille. Il avale tout en une bouchée."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En el interior de su pelaje revuelto esconde la comida que luego engullirá de una vez."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ボサボサの 体毛の 中に 食べ物を 隠して 持ち歩く。 食べる ときは ゴクリと まる飲み。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il mange chaque jour l’équivalent de son propre poids. Il consomme sa nourriture en quantité, mais il se moque bien du goût qu’elle a."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Necesita ingerir cada día el equivalente a su peso corporal en comida. Le importa poco el sabor que pueda tener."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It needs to consume its own weight in food every day. As far as flavor is concerned, it’s indifferent."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"毎日 自分の 体重と 同じ 量の 餌が 必要。 味に ついては 気に しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Dès qu’il voit un mets alléchant, il le ramasse aussitôt et l’avale tout de go. C’est pour cela qu’il grossit à vue d’œil, ce petit glouton."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"En cuanto encuentra algo comestible, lo recoge y lo engulle de un bocado, por lo que cada día está más y más gordo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"When it finds something that looks like it might be edible, it goes right ahead and swallows it whole. That’s why it gets fatter day by day."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"喰えそうな ものを 見つけたら とりあえず 拾って 丸呑み。 だから 日に日に 肥っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il a tendance à cacher des aliments dans son épaisse fourrure... et à les oublier là. L’odeur putride qui s’en dégage alors est plutôt gênante."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Aprovecha su largo pelaje para ocultar comida, pero se le suele olvidar y acaba generando un olor a putrefacción muy molesto para los demás."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It hides food under its long fur, but it sometimes forgets about it and causes a stinky disturbance."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"長い 毛の 下に 食べ物を 隠すが 隠したことを 忘れて 異臭 騒ぎに なることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Dès qu’il voit quelque chose de comestible, il le ramasse et l’avale tout de go. Son estomac lui permet de digérer même la nourriture avariée."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"En cuanto encuentra algo comestible, lo recoge y lo engulle de un bocado. Su robusto estómago le permite ingerir alimentos podridos sin inmutarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Anything that looks edible, Munchlax will go on and swallow whole. Its stomach is tough enough to handle it even if the food has gone rotten."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"食えそうなもの だったら とりあえず 拾って 丸呑み。 腐ったエサでも 平気な 頑丈な 胃を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il ne pense qu’à manger énormément. Il n’a que faire du goût et n’hésite d’ailleurs pas à engloutir de la nourriture avariée."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Atiborrarse de comida es su fijación. Como no le hace ascos a nada, puede ingerir alimentos podridos sin inmutarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Stuffing itself with vast amounts of food is its only concern. Whether the food is rotten or fresh, yummy or tasteless—it does not care."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"とにかく たくさん 食べることに 夢中。 味も 気にしないし 腐っていても 平気 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il conserve sa nourriture sous son épaisse fourrure. Il lui arrive d’en offrir un peu à ceux en qui il a confiance."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Guarda alimentos bajo el pelaje. Compartirá un pequeño bocado de vez en cuando con quien logre ganarse su confianza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It stores food beneath its fur. It might share just one bite, but only if it really trusts you."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体毛の下に エサを 貯める。 信頼した 相手には ひと口だけ わけてくれることも。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost."}],"varieties":[{"id":446,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","le